WEBVTT

00:07:57.674 --> 00:08:01.759
that my mother used to type on all the time as a legal secretary.

00:08:01.759 --> 00:08:04.280
It has 10 variations. (Typing noise)

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:06.409
(Typing noise)

00:08:06.409 --> 00:08:09.782
There's a shift.

00:08:09.782 --> 00:08:14.047
Ten variations. This is, like, spin the letter around.

00:08:14.047 --> 00:08:17.651
(Typing noises)

00:08:17.651 --> 00:08:24.636
This is, like, a ring of letters. (Typing noises)

00:08:24.636 --> 00:08:27.547
This is 20 years old, so it's kind of a --

00:08:27.547 --> 00:08:29.361
Let's see, this is —

00:08:29.361 --> 00:08:31.477
I love the French film "The Red Balloon."